        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Creates a Completed Task "Amount changed" on an Opportunity whenever its Amount changes on update. Uses TriggerBase.idToNumberOfTimesSeenAfterUpdate to skip the second after-update pass caused by the rounding action (Order 20), ensuring at most one task per opportunity per transaction.</value>
    </values>
